{"id": "DeWKHLvRYJv", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Why did Shiva's dance almost END the universe? 🔱 The story of Mahadev, Sati, and the most heartbreaking dance in our culture. 💔\n\nSati's father, Daksha, insulted Shiva during his grand yagna. Unable to bear the humiliation of her beloved, Sati gave up her body in the sacrificial fire.\n\nWhen Shiva learned what had happened, his grief turned into fury.\n\nHe lifted Sati's body and began the **Rudra Tandava** — the cosmic dance of destruction. The worlds trembled. The universe itself was at risk. 🔥\n\nTo stop the devastation, Vishnu sent his Sudarshan Chakra to divide Sati's body. Wherever her body parts fell, the land became sacred — giving rise to the **Shakti Peethas**. 🙏\n\nShiva withdrew into deep meditation, carrying his grief for ages.\n\nThen Sati returned as **Shailputri**, the daughter of the mountains. 🌄\n\nAnd their story began again.\n\n📚 Meet Maa Shailputri in Book 1 of Rishi Katha's Navadurga Series — picture books bringing Maa's nine forms to life for children.\n\n🎉 THANK YOU SALE — LAST DAY!\n\n📖 Books 1–3 for just ₹400 (regularly ₹500) \n🚚 Free shipping \n⏰ Ends tonight, 11 October, at midnight\n\n👉 Order at rishikatha.com (link in bio)\n\n💬 Is there a Shakti Peeth near YOU? Comment your city below! 👇\n\nSave this story for your kids and share it with someone who loves Mahadev. 🙏\n\n#Shiva #Mahadev #ShivTandav #Tandava #Sati #ShaktiPeeth #Shailputri #Nataraja #HarHarMahadev #IndianMythology #HinduMythology #MythologyForKids #RishiKatha #Navadurga", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1791704970, "like_count": 79893, "comment_count": 363, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2141054829955107a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.228, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2